      "id": "PRI-L2-003-01",
      "name": "Privacy Requirement 1",
      "description": "The system shall ensure privacy (data minimisation, consent management, data subject rights per GDPR and ISO 27701): Neither a checking-account nor a saving-account can have a negative balance",
